<section>
    <h2>Reading Sample</h2>

    <div class="type-sample">
        <p>Good typography is invisible. It should not distract the reader from the content but instead guide them
            through it with ease and comfort.</p>
        <p>The baseline grid provides a framework for this invisibility. When text aligns consistently, the eye can move
            naturally from line to line without conscious effort.</p>
        <p>Josef Müller-Brockmann wrote: "The grid system is an aid, not a guarantee. It permits a number of possible
            uses and each designer can look for a solution appropriate to his personal style."</p>
    </div>
</section>
